WEBVTT

00:10:30.042 --> 00:10:34.421
And it shares a snack
instead of an infographic

00:10:34.421 --> 00:10:37.341
or a shocking piece of media.

00:10:38.509 --> 00:10:41.011
Now moment of truth time.

00:10:41.053 --> 00:10:43.347
Let's see how these guys
are doing in here.

00:10:44.598 --> 00:10:46.934
Oh, yes, this will do nicely.

00:10:49.645 --> 00:10:53.232
Now I'm going to be real real
with all of you

00:10:53.273 --> 00:10:56.068
because I would never
not be real real with you.

00:10:57.152 --> 00:10:58.987
Some people ...

00:10:59.029 --> 00:11:01.240
OK, get out of there, babies.